      "statement": "The repository is operated from the project root with Python 3.10+; the CI installation uses Python 3.11, a CPU-indexed PyTorch wheel, transformers, datasets, wandb, and requirements-dev.txt, while the recommended GPU installation uses the CUDA 12.1 PyTorch index.",
